Babata modifications:
- The AppArmor profile has a dedicated babata-native name and permits
  Codex's native bubblewrap construction mounts in a child user namespace.
  It retains proc/sys protections and disallows AF_ALG and AF_VSOCK.
- The seccomp profile retains its restrictive default and adds the exact
  reviewed clone/unshare flags and mount/pivot_root/detach operations used
  by the native sandbox. The container drops all capabilities and runs
  under the dedicated AppArmor policy; this file is not a standalone
  justification to grant broader container privileges.

